A match over a string field with no [_] arm: a value no arm maps would reach
a target that does not accept it.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	kind: string
}
-- ship/1.0.thema --
Schema: {
	kind: int
}

ForwardLens: {
	v0_0: _
	v1_0: {
		kind: match(v0_0.kind, {
			"a": 1
		})
	}
}
-- out/error --
error[E0351]: match on kind is not exhaustive: 0.0's kind may hold values no arm matches and 1.0's kind does not accept; add a [_] arm
 --> 1.0.thema:8:9
  |
8 |         kind: match(v0_0.kind, {
  |               ^^^^^
  |
